Comment: 0,0:12:15.76,0:12:22.05,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Comment: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:29.23,EG,,0,0,0,,Mobile Suit Gundam
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:35.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It is the year 0079 of the Universal Century.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.41,0:01:39.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Giant space colonies have been built\Naround the Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:43.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}As each group of colonies was completed,\Nit was given a number. Side 1...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.09,0:01:45.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...Side 2, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.01,0:01:48.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Two years after\Nthe seventh Side was built...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.22,0:01:52.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...war broke out between the Principality\Nof Zeon and the Earth Federation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:56.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Four Sides were destroyed\Nduring the fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.10,0:01:59.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...and only Side 6 remained.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.20,0:02:02.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The White Base, with its young crew...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.73,0:02:06.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}... is now making its way across\NCentral Asia toward Europe...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.74,0:02:10.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...destroying M'Quve's\Nmining bases as it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.14,0:02:22.08,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He came out!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.76,0:02:29.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn, I missed him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.93,0:02:31.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright's not going to be too happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.68,0:02:40.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright, Magella Attacks are\Nspreading out to starboard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.24,0:02:43.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright, your orders...?\NIs something the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.76,0:02:45.82,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No... I'm fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.82,0:02:49.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Have the Gundam... No...\NHave the Guntank take care of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.83,0:02:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:04.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Here goes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.05,0:03:40.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Resistance from the enemy base\Nhas completely subsided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:44.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is that right...\NOrder the Gundam and the Guntank to return.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.89,0:03:48.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Take off quickly as soon as\Nthey're safely aboard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.68,0:03:51.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright, what course should I set?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:53.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.38,0:04:07.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.95,0:04:10.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai, we're still in battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.63,0:04:12.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Could someone help him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:13.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.40,0:04:15.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Job.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.37,0:04:18.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.69,0:04:33.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That Elran doesn't give me\Nvery much useful information.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.48,0:04:34.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Your regular report, sir{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.45,0:04:42.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}What Is It, sir?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.78,0:04:48.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's this I hear about the loss of\NBauxite Mining Bases No. 7 and No. 86?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.50,0:04:51.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The defenses we had\Nshould have been adequate!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:56.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}But the capabilities of the Trojan Horse and Its{\i}\N{\i1}mobile suits were beyond what we expected{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.76,0:04:59.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's enough.\NI'll take care of the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.09,0:05:00.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yes, sir{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.14,0:05:04.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Judock. Go tell General Elran this...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.68,0:05:05.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.77,0:05:07.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,For the entire day tomorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.27,0:05:12.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,... he must slow down the movement of\NFederation forces in Eastern Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.10,0:05:14.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I understand, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.45,0:05:17.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Judock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.46,0:05:18.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.79,0:05:23.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Fix your uniform.\NYour Federation collar is showing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:32.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Nice and clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.30,0:05:36.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.64,0:05:39.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey! Settle down!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.39,0:05:41.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.52,0:05:44.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See, I warned you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:46.20,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now, you have to rinse off completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.40,0:05:49.90,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.90,0:05:52.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You and Kikka are both girls, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:53.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.61,0:05:55.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then why is Kikka so flat here?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Naughty boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.85,0:06:14.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.79,0:06:17.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can you get me\Nreplacement part No. 1-33?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:19.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.23,0:06:23.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.52,0:06:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Isn't it there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.49,0:06:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.42,0:06:28.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the Medea delivered it the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.15,0:06:30.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If we don't replace it, it'll still work...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.31,0:06:33.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,... but it's a class D consumable part,\Nso the unit will be much less reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.41,0:06:35.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It must have been put away somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.65,0:06:37.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go ask Mr. Bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.36,0:06:40.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll go too. There're other parts\NI have to talk to him about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.46,0:06:43.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hey, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:44.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.72,0:06:45.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.75,0:06:46.51,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,My...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.51,0:06:47.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.79,0:06:49.84,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two stink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.84,0:06:51.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's true! You really stink!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.68,0:06:52.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Phew!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.88,0:06:55.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,- Stinky!\N- So stinky!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.35,0:06:57.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You two should at least use the shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.99,0:07:00.74,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We don't have time for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:02.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,See you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:05.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, you filthy creatures!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:06.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Filthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.41,0:07:09.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh? Where's Mr. Bright?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.40,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He's in the infirmary. What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.40,0:07:14.63,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then... where's Ms. Mirai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.63,0:07:18.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,She's checking on Mr. Bright\Nin the infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.00,0:07:22.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We really need her here now.\NShe should let Sunmalo take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:24.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The hangar's this way, Amuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.42,0:07:28.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll drop by the infirmary and ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.29,0:07:29.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll wait in the hangar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.39,0:07:31.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.89,0:07:39.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,The fever isn't going down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.06,0:07:42.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I gave him a sedative just now.\NIt'll come down soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.91,0:07:45.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh, Amuro. is there something you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.15,0:07:48.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.58,0:07:52.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So, did you ask about the parts?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.45,0:07:53.83,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.22,0:08:11.06,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Vice! They'll be passing over us\Nany moment now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.06,0:08:13.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I want you all\Nto check your equipment again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:16.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't carry even a sliver of metal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:18.27,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lang, take off your watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:21.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all plastic,\Nlike the rest of the equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.77,0:08:24.31,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Everyone, put on your lift jets!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.45,0:08:33.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,, How's the gas pressure in the lift jets?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.45,0:08:34.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're all okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.78,0:08:37.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We checked it before too.\NI'm sure it's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.59,0:08:42.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.69,0:08:54.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Those guys are in for a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.89,0:08:56.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They can't detect us at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.97,0:08:59.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Lang, keep your mouth shut\Nuntil we've succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.93,0:09:00.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.70,0:10:20.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.57,0:10:24.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, according to the computer,\Nit's just exhaustion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:27.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,He should be all right\Nafter 2 or 3 days of rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.44,0:10:28.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.60,0:10:51.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.55,0:10:52.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:13.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,W-What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.42,0:11:14.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,An explosion...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.72,0:11:24.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.91,0:11:25.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They got us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.58,0:11:30.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know how they did it, but\Nthey got our Minovsky particle emitters...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:32.42,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and the E.C.M. transmitters!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.42,0:11:33.76,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That means...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.76,0:11:36.97,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes. We're completely vulnerable\Nto the enemy's sensors.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.97,0:11:39.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What about the radar?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.35,0:11:42.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's undamaged.\NI wonder why they didn't destroy it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.60,0:11:44.10,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:48.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mirai, please don't think that\Nthe operators overlooked something.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:51.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I would never...!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:56.28,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Operators, sound the alarm anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.28,0:11:58.45,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Put everyone on level 2 battle stations.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.45,0:11:58.78,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.16,0:12:02.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Damn! No more time\Nfor replacing parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:06.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Incoming!\NFormation of 20 Dopp-like aircraft!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.91,0:12:10.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Must be fighters! Amuro! Ryu...!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.17,0:12:12.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No! Amuro! Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.46,0:12:14.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launch Core Fighters, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.23,0:12:31.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Please hurry with the Core Fighter launch!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.23,0:12:34.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! I'll go ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.07,0:12:37.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But we should stay close together\Nwhen we fight. Got it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.03,0:12:37.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Roger!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.74,0:12:47.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another Dopp formation!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:52.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding, Amuro!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:54.71,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two Core Fighters are no match against that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.71,0:12:58.92,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I agree! What was she thinking\Nwhen she deployed the Core Fighters?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.92,0:13:02.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Another formation incoming!\NCourse, 2-70! Speed, Mach 5!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:05.60,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Altitude, 12,000! About 15 fighters!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.60,0:13:06.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:09.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Should we deploy the Guntank\Nto the rear for cover?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.77,0:13:11.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.77,0:13:14.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,First wave, at 12 o'clock, directly overhead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.11,0:13:17.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Amuro! Hayato!\NCover the White Base!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.92,0:13:36.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's no good! There're too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.60,0:13:46.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You mustn't, Mr. Bright!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:49.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,To the bridge...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.48,0:13:52.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You're kidding! Not in your condition!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.10,0:13:56.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why can't I move my body?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.19,0:13:57.52,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Am I afraid?{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:00.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu...!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.61,0:14:02.07,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.07,0:14:05.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu! Cover the port side\Nwith the Guncannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.78,0:14:07.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mr. Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.46,0:14:15.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We'll launch the Gundam\Nand Guntank parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.50,0:14:17.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please inform the mechanics.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.38,0:14:20.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai! You're making them\Ndo a mid-air transfer...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.09,0:14:23.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...without the Gunperry,\Nand during battle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.18,0:14:24.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,ls that wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.43,0:14:27.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If deploying the Core Fighters\Nwas a mistake...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.01,0:14:28.93,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,... I have to correct it right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:31.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai, I think Amuro is capable of doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.98,0:14:33.14,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.14,0:14:36.94,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we can have Hayato transfer\Non the White Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.94,0:14:39.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's perfect, Sayla.\NWe'll do both at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.61,0:14:40.65,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.95,0:14:48.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! A mid-air transfer during battle?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.66,0:14:50.29,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.29,0:14:53.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.\NWe're launching the Gundam parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.25,0:14:56.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato, return to the White Base\Nand transfer to the Guncannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.00,0:14:58.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Why don't you use Mr. Kai?\NHe's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.21,0:15:01.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sorry... Kai's on the anti-air turrets\Nand can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.17,0:15:06.01,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I understand.\NPlease launch the Gundam parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.01,0:15:07.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me if the Gundam gets hit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.52,0:15:13.18,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're going too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.18,0:15:15.73,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish they'd consider my situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:22.36,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sensor synchronized!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.24,0:15:31.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Launching A Parts!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.71,0:15:35.91,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're rushing too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.01,0:15:44.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam! Here I go!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.07,0:16:10.32,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Our plan to flush out the Trojan Horse...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.32,0:16:12.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,... is proceeding quite well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Be careful, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.87,0:16:16.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They've spread a net on the ground as well.\NGot it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.66,0:16:18.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.12,0:16:22.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No one told us the Zeons had\Nsuch a powerful force in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.67,0:16:24.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We just have to accept reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.59,0:16:26.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Y-You're right...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.13,0:16:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Marker! Can you find us an escape route?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.43,0:16:31.26,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,70 degrees to starboard\Nis relatively clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.26,0:16:32.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Roger that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.06,0:16:37.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And they don't even know why\Nwe let them keep their radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.31,0:16:40.81,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Because they have the radar...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:45.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...they analyze the situation\Nand fall into our trap on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.19,0:16:46.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Impressive as always, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.61,0:16:47.19,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.04,0:16:56.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.54,0:17:03.46,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm out of ammo! I'll just have to...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.38,0:17:07.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.35,0:17:17.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Does the Guncannon\Nhave any ammo left?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.85,0:17:18.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That was the last!{\i}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.98,0:17:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! Cover me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.87,0:17:40.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.85,0:18:06.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can't take much more of this.\NWhere's the White Base?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.98,0:18:12.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Let's jump and get out of here!\NAll right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.03,0:18:13.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.20,0:18:18.66,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Two enemy mobile suits\Nhave escaped from our encirclement!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.37,0:18:22.62,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh well. We'll just finish them\Nalong with the Trojan Horse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.88,0:18:30.38,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We've been hit in Blocks 13 and 16!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.38,0:18:32.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Are the engines all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.22,0:18:33.55,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We can still fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.55,0:18:34.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Then we're going to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.97,0:18:37.30,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Is running all you think about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.30,0:18:39.85,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,This is the best I can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.85,0:18:42.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What more do you want from me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.69,0:18:47.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I wish Ryu were here at a time like this...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.56,0:18:48.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,No...!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.07,0:18:51.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Gundam and Guncannon, back on board!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.61,0:18:54.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Can they do another sortie, Sayla?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.57,0:18:58.41,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll ask. I doubt it's possible, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.70,0:19:02.87,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla! How long do you think it takes\Nto replenish our weapons and energy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.87,0:19:05.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please think reasonably\Nabout the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.50,0:19:07.33,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Amuro, that's going too far{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.33,0:19:10.13,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're giving orders{\i}\N{\i1}based on the overall situation{\i}.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:14.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'm going out as soon as\Nthe beam rifle's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.80,0:19:16.80,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,All right! It'll be about 2 minutes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.80,0:19:19.39,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,If only Ryu were here now...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.39,0:19:21.68,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Hayato! Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:28.77,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's right...Good...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.77,0:19:31.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Come in a little bit further.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.08,0:19:44.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Strange. The Dopps are withdrawing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.58,0:19:45.58,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Already?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.71,0:19:48.79,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to get out of here now!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.79,0:19:50.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Go after the Dopps! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.83,0:20:24.95,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Let us shut down main engine No. 2!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:26.75,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It'll explode at this rate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.00,0:20:30.88,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Pressure build-up in the third nozzle\Nof main engine No. 1.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.88,0:20:32.21,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We have to shut it down, quickly!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.84,0:20:41.72,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,So it was that mega particle cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.72,0:20:44.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll take it out... in one shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.36,0:20:55.23,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,It's all over!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.23,0:20:58.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are you saying, Mirai?\NYou're in command now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.49,0:21:00.11,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.05,0:21:16.05,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're done for...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.05,0:21:17.17,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mirai...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:21.89,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What?! The attack force is returning!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.89,0:21:23.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,They're going to finish us off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.93,0:21:27.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I have an idea!\NI don't know if this will work, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.02,0:21:27.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.35,0:21:28.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Sayla...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.43,0:21:30.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We take the safety off the smoke bombs...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.48,0:21:32.44,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,...and set them off in the launch tubes!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.44,0:21:34.61,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,There'll be a lot of damage.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:36.98,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But if we can fool the enemy, we'll survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.98,0:21:38.03,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Mirai?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.57,0:21:41.57,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,I'll leave it to you. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.57,0:21:43.37,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.37,0:21:45.24,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ryu...! Help me...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:57.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Bright...! Ryu...!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.67,0:21:59.09,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Help me...!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.18,0:22:09.56,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Oh! They're off the radar!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:13.02,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We're safe for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.23,0:22:17.15,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What are we going to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.15,0:22:20.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Well, the only thing we can do\Nis ask General Revil for support.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.03,0:22:23.49,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,And if it shows up...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.03,0:22:25.99,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,What's the battle status?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.99,0:22:27.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Ms. Mirai?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.12,0:22:29.12,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,We made it through somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.12,0:22:31.54,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,But will we arrive in time for Odessa Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.54,0:22:33.50,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Odessa Day...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.50,0:22:36.00,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,That's the counter-offensive\Nin Europe, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.01,0:22:43.47,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.97,0:22:45.59,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Sayla!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.59,0:22:49.64,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,Please send a coded message\Nto General Revil of the Federation Forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.33,0:23:18.25,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}A Medea transport team is\Nassaulted by Goufs...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.25,0:23:20.67,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}...scattering relief supplies in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.67,0:23:25.43,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even the Gundam, joining in the fight,\Nis damaged by the Gouf's powerful attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.43,0:23:30.22,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After delivering the G Parts from\Nthe transport plane, Matilda cries...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.22,0:23:32.35,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Rise up, Amuro!"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:36.69,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mobile Suit Gundam. Next episode...\NMatilda's Rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.56,0:23:40.48,Dialogue,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Will you be able to survive?
